 * Declares the TagSymbol class, and the TagSite record.
 *
 * TagSymbol represents a tag declaration(`TagDecl`), and TagSite one of the
 * tags written on top of a declaration, `#[name(args)]`, kept on the symbol
 * it tags.
 *
 * <hr>
